Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:11.82,Class- Default,Demon King,0,0,0,,If you fail to stop me, the world \Nwill come to an end, Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:19.66,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So this is all I've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:44.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Enough with the cheap moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:46.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's settle things once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:48.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You and me, going all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:50.30,Class- Default,Demon King,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.92,Class- Default,Demon King,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:00.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Series, Fifth Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:03.24,Class- Default,Demon King,0,0,0,,Satanic power at full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.46,Class- Default,Demon King,0,0,0,,Be reduced to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:10.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Annihilator!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:51.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's finally over...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:14.88,Class- Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.03,Class- Default,Student 2,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.28,Class- Default,Student K,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:18.57,Class- Default,Student A,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:20.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh! They're greeting each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:22.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Is that what friends do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:22.86,Class- Default,Student E,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.04,Class- Default,Student B,0,0,0,,Morning. You're here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:28.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see! This is what normal people do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:31.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:37.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Starting today, I'm going to make friends \Nand live life as an ordinary person!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:42.01,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:42.01,sign_3830_26_Earnest,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)}Earnest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:48.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay! Time to make some friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:49.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:50.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:51.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:52.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.75,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Good morning! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.75,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Pretty funny student we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.78,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Good morning! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.78,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Do you think he's a new transfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:01.28,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:04.69,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:05.66,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.23,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,You sure are a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.44,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,I'm Kassim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.00,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,My name's Clay. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.33,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I'm Yessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.85,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, um... I'm Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:17.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm here to make some friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:22.36,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, would you \Nlike to be friends with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:23.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I've got four whole friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:26.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, I could make ten friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, hold that thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Even 100 friends doesn't sound so far-fetched!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:36.32,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If you want to make 100 friends,\Nyou'll have to befriend the whole student body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.13,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What are all of you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:42.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why are you making a commotion \Nin the middle of the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.24,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:46.55,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,You are all students at the \Nprestigious Rosewood Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.73,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,That's Earnest Flaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:50.88,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,You should strive to always follow the \Nrules and behave in an orderly manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:51.58,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,She's the top student in this school, \Nso everyone calls her the Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:56.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.21,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:00.45,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,U-Um, Lady Earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:02.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,No need for the title!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:05.84,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Well, it seems Blade just \Ntransferred into the school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:07.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,A new student?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:13.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,This academy only admits those who aspire \Nto be heroes who protect this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:14.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,There's no way they'd permit \Nsuch a late admission!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:16.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I don't really care about being a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:18.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm just here to make some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:19.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You don't really care?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:22.32,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What halfhearted resolve you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:26.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, almost forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I need to go to the headmaster's office!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Can you show me the way to \Nthe headmaster's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.03,0:04:33.28,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:37.08,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why'd it have to be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:41.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,This is Earnest Flaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:45.45,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm here with a brat who lost his \Nway and was on the verge of tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:46.67,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,You may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:48.99,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:59.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wh-What brings you here, Sir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:03.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Y-You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:06.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't you have any idea \Nwho you stand before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:10.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Please forgive his rudeness, \NYour Majesty the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:16.29,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I've heard all about you from the \Nprevious headmaster, Miss Earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:18.21,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It seems you have quite the excellent record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no. I have a long way to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:23.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Excuse me, "previous headmaster"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:24.69,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:28.09,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,As of today, I will be acting \Nas the new headmaster here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:29.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your Majesty is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:32.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why, I hear Your Majesty is \Nquite the accomplished warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:35.13,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,To be instructed by Your Majesty himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:38.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I find myself lacking words to \Nexpress my joy at the sheer honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:41.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I could never have imagined I would get \Na chance to speak with Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How can I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:45.19,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, I really am so truly struck with awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.19,Class - Top,King,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:46.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:48.66,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,You may take your leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.16,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I must speak with him in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:59.67,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,What's the deal with that boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.32,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,He's so friendly with His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:03.24,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:04.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey! Thanks to you,\NI've gotten on her bad side!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:05.05,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,What could be the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:08.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And what are you doing here, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:11.47,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,You see, Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:15.26,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I want you to regain your powers as a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:17.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I want to be an ordinary person!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:18.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Normal as can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.04,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,The students here are really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:24.16,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,They should serve well \Nin your rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're not listening, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:29.49,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I plan on making sweeping changes \Nto the curriculum, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.38,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,My predecessor had a bit of a lenient streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:35.57,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,We're trying to nurture heroes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:37.00,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Great heroes like you—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:39.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's no need for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The Demon King's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:45.17,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I received reports of the Great Hero \Nand the Demon King trading blows,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.61,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,resulting in mutual annihilation \Nof their powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:48.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.02,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,But I have faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:53.66,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,The Great Hero's powers will be resurrected!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:57.64,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,And that's because you are the Great Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:01.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This old man's gone off the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:13.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why are {\i1}you{\i0} here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:17.84,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,This is the advanced class!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:21.62,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I took the exam for the lower classes, \Nbut I was told to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:24.17,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Did you bribe someone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:24.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:27.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Did you gain back-door \Nadmission into this school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:31.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You must have cheated somehow to be\N placed straight into the advanced class!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:37.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Besides, this isn't the kind of academy \Nthat admits halfhearted people like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:38.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't call me halfhearted!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm dead serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,About making 100 friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:44.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's be friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:46.02,Class- Default,Scientist,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:47.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:48.65,Class- Default,Priestess,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's be friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:52.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:53.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:55.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's be friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:55.28,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:57.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:01.33,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,D-Don't pat my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:06.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.82,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The instructor has asked\N everyone to assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:11.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:15.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,He's asking for your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.70,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:18.85,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,She's always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:20.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.65,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You need to listen when people are talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.64,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:27.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:28.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:30.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.92,Class- Default,Instructor,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:36.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'd like to test the \Ntransfer student's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:40.00,Class- Default,Instructor,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't in today's lesson plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You don't mind, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:43.54,Class- Default,Instructor,0,0,0,,Go ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:51.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's made of enchanted metal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:53.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,And what if it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:54.88,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:58.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,simply slicing through it is something \Nall the advanced students can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.20,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your job is to prove yourself \Nto everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:05.19,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If you can't, I'll have you admit to your \Nillicit entry and leave the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:08.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,The advanced class is on \Na whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:09.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How many levels are we talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.81,0:09:12.40,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? W-Well... two...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:13.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,No, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.20,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's three whole levels different!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:18.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see. Three levels, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:20.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Then, Second Sword should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:27.18,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Wait, the shape of his fighting spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:28.92,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Dragon Series?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:30.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Dragon Series? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:57.82,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:01.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hmm... Meh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.33,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:12.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Who in the world... {\i1}are{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:23.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I-I'm ordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:26.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Just your exceedingly average,\Nordinary person!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:31.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Ordinary... Ordinary?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:41.53,Class- Default,Boy Student,0,0,0,,No, the best thing they \Nserve is their hamburger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:44.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:50.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Like I said, I'm just ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.52,Class- Default,Girl Student 1,0,0,0,,And that's why she messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.97,Class- Default,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,What, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:56.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey! There are seats here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:01.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.84,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's gotten into them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:09.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,This table is basically reserved for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:12.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wait... are you being bullied?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:14.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You can talk to me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You're a real moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Everyone's scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Scared of you? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:30.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Whoa, what {\i1}is{\i0} this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:33.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what it is, but it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:35.64,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? It's just curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:36.50,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Tonkatsu curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:38.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So it's called tonkatsu curry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Tonkatsu curry is super amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:42.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The guy who invented it was a real genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:45.32,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I take back what I said about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What was that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:49.58,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I mean when I accused you \Nof illicit entry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:50.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:51.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:54.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's been bothering me,\Nand you don't even remember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:59.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Since I don't remember,\Nyou shouldn't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:03.45,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I admit you've got a bit of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:09.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:13.13,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I swear! You're so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:17.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You've done so much to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:19.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:21.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm a new transfer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I thought I wouldn't be \Nable to make any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:26.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? Friends? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:30.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait, m-me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:31.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:34.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Look, we're eating lunch together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:35.15,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That makes us pals!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:40.65,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,W-Well, I don't mind being your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.09,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:44.15,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,The Empress is so quick to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:02.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:05.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Eating together makes you friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Friends, he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,My very first friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:37.29,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Surrender yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:52.54,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Destroy! Slash! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:53.72,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.05,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm the next head of the Flaming family!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.65,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I won't give in to the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Leonard, take this fight seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:16.92,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Dear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:18.62,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,We may be simulating a real fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:22.46,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,but I'd rather not wield \Nmy lance against a lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wow! So awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.22,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Come! It's time for this show to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:43.21,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,How merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:44.74,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,It seems I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:46.57,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:01.56,Class- Default,Magical Girl,0,0,0,,The Empress has been kind of scary lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:02.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:12.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,If you continue this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.37,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You're up next, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:42.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:46.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That Dragon Series of yours \Nis no big deal if I dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:52.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But will you be all right in that condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.75,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:55.06,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:02.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:06.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:15.66,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:19.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Make her better, like you did for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:22.92,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I can heal diseases and injuries, \Neven from the brink of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:25.67,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,But spells and curses are \Noutside of my expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:28.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:32.53,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:33.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:34.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:37.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:40.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:43.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Did I... um... do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:46.04,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Something really awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Really awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:49.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, you just suddenly fell unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:52.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, it was really awful carrying you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:53.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Y-You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:55.74,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm not that heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.00,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You should rest a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.04,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,That affliction of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:00.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:02.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.79,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,No. Get back in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:04.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:06.17,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I'm not budging.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:10.17,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It seems like Earnest feels okay,\Nso why not let her go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:12.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on her instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.35,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:15.17,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.18,Class- Default,Student,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I can walk on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:26.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You can lean on me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We're friends, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:33.08,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone what you \Nheard in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Looks like I owe that old man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Not that I mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:13.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Rosewood Academy's data...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So that demon sword's name is Asmodeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dunno why, but it gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:24.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:33.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why do you want to talk in private?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Are you trying to threaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:36.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:38.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why would I threaten you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:40.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Maybe you want my spot as top student.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:42.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:44.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's more important is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:46.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:48.58,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait, that's, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:52.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I said we could be friends, \Nbut anything more is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know the secret behind your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:00.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That sword has its own will,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:03.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,and grants its owner tremendous power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:07.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But you don't have full ownership of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:10.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.47,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,When I was six years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:19.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I unknowingly laid my hands on a cursed \Ndemon sword in the Flaming family's custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:22.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It tried to take over my body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:25.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,and the demon sword's will flowed through me,\Nhungering for blood and carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:29.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Ever since, I've been \Nholding back those urges.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:33.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,As soon as I let my guard down, \NI can hear it still, to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:38.21,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,The voice of Asmodeus,\Nbegging me to let it slash and burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:40.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But it hasn't taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:41.81,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:43.74,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Thanks to my stubbornness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:44.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There is a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:46.29,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:51.25,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I need the demon sword to\Nacknowledge me as its owner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:52.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.63,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What if I fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Then a bloodthirsty demon would come to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:57.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:58.66,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How can you say something so irresponsible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.46,0:20:01.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If the demon comes to life...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:04.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Like I said, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:04.84,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:07.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If that happens, I'll cut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:09.21,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:14.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't think I can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.43,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:19.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:20.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:29.25,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Demon Sword Asmodeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:31.66,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I am Earnest Flaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:34.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I beseech thee to form a pact with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:39.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Obey thy oath from days bygone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,and receive my being within thy own!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:43.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Try my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:45.68,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,See if thou can consume me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.89,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:51.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I have faith in you, Earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I have faith as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:57.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,that you'll bring this all to an end,\Nno matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.32,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So you must be Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'll keep it brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:11.80,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Submit yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.50,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I am fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.37,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I am power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:20.55,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I am pure violence that \Nreigns over all destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:24.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Looks like it means a fight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:25.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:40.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Destroy, destroy, destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:42.40,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:44.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Burn, burn, burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:48.11,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, what fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:50.43,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I don't want to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:53.24,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Not when there's so much \Nto destroy around me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:56.72,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,My house, my family, my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:03.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:05.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I can fight now, thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:08.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Even if I fail, I know he'll take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:11.27,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Which is why I'll fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:12.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,of my own will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.56,0:22:14.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,For the sake of my own pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:17.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,My name...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:20.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,My name is Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:23.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Earnest Flaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.72,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:57.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:09.70,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:11.36,Class - Top,Yessica,0,0,0,,Yeah! And then Kassim was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.35,0:23:11.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:26.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Does it look weird on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:28.50,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You look quite splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.50,0:23:29.76,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
